n\n右侧前景处，一盏设计独特的现代落地灯格外醒目，由三个透明的圆柱形玻璃罩垂直堆叠而成，每个罩内都透出温暖的黄色光芒，营造出温馨的氛围。落地灯后方隐约可见深色木质墙面和一个壁炉的轮廓。\n\n整体色调以中性色为主——灰、白、木色、黑，点缀着画作的暖色和灯光的暖黄，营造出一种宁静、高雅、充满艺术气息的现代奢华感。构图开阔，光影层次分明，细节精致，极具电影感和高级感。\n\nModern minimalist living room, wide-angle panoramic view, facing a massive piece of art.\n\nCenter of the frame is a clean, light gray micro-cement wall with a fine, smooth texture and no extra decorations. Mounted on it is a super-wide abstract landscape painting, rich in colors, featuring ochre, earthy yellow, and turquoise blue tones, depicting a winding river or canyon terrain with striking visual impact. Below the painting is a low, long, floating wooden TV cabinet with a simple design and thin metal handles.\n\nTo the left sits a large, light gray L-shaped fabric sofa with streamlined lines and thick cushions, casually adorned with a few matching throw pillows. In front of the sofa is a rectangular coffee table with a glass top and slender legs, supported by a heavy, natural stone base with a rough texture, creating a contrast with the smooth glass. Two white books are stacked on the coffee table.\n\nThe floor is covered with large areas of light gray shaggy carpet, covering most of the living space. On both sides of the room are floor-to-ceiling black-framed windows, offering a view of lush green trees and a corner of the courtyard outside, allowing ample natural light to flood the space, making it bright and airy.\n\nIn the right foreground, a distinctive modern floor lamp stands out, composed of three transparent cylindrical glass shades stacked vertically, each emitting a warm yellow glow, creating a cozy atmosphere. Behind the lamp, a dark wooden wall and a glimpse of a fireplace outline can be seen.\n\nThe overall color palette is dominated by neutral tones—gray, white, wood, black—accented by the warm colors of the painting and the warm yellow of the lighting, creating a serene, elegant, and artistically sophisticated modern luxury feel. The composition is spacious, with distinct layers of light and shadow, and exquisite details, exuding a cinematic and high-end quality."], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "anything", "link": 163, "label": "输入任何", "type": "*", "localized_name": "anything"}], "flags": {}, "id": 108, "type": "easy showAnything", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "easy showAnything"}, "order": 21}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "MODEL", "slot_index": 0, "links": [168], "label": "模型", "type": "MODEL", "localized_name": "模型"}], "size": [397.64788818359375, 82], "shape": 1, "pos": [-1949.871337890625, 2775.067138671875], "widgets_values": ["flux1-dev-fp8-Kijai.safetensors", "fp8_e4m3fn"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "unet_name"}, "name": "unet_name", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "UNET名称"}, {"widget": {"name": "weight_dtype"}, "name": "weight_dtype", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "剪枝类型"}], "flags": {}, "id": 110, "type": "UNETLoader", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "UNETLoader"}, "order": 11}, {"outputs": [{"name": "MODEL", "links": [165], "label": "模型", "type": "MODEL", "localized_name": "模型"}], "color": "#223", "shape": 1, "widgets_values": ["flux-lora-大家电场景图.safetensors", 0.8000000000000002], "inputs": [{"name": "model", "link": 168, "label": "模型", "type": "MODEL", "localized_name": "模型"}, {"widget": {"name": "lora_name"}, "name": "lora_name", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "LoRA名称"}, {"widget": {"name": "strength_model"}, "name": "strength_model", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "模型强度"}], "flags": {"collapsed": false}, "type": "LoraLoaderModelOnly", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#335", "size": [396.6648864746094, 82], "pos": [-1498.178955078125, 2774.608154296875], "id": 112, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "LoraLoaderModelOnly"}, "order": 16}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [], "size": [140, 66], "pos": [-963.7000122070312, 2784.82958984375], "widgets_values": [], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "anything", "li